mited.(香港)に関する固定資産につきましても、経営環境の変化を踏まえ回収可能性を見直した結果、これらに関連会社の固定資産に関する減損処理７千２百万円を行い、特別損失を計上する見込みとなりました。２. 持分法適用関係会社の投資損失の計上 　当社は、持分法適用関係会社の事業計画を保守的に再検討した結果、投資に伴うのれん相当額の未償却残高全額を持分法による投資損失として２億５千万円を営業外費用として計上する見込みとなりました。３.2026年３月期通期連結業績予想（2025年４月１日～2026年３月31日）", null, "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 27700000000, "27,700", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 1200000000, "1,200", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 1200000000, "1,200", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 840000000, "840", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 63.16, "63.16", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 26651000000, "26,651", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 1386000000, "1,386", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 1137000000, "1,137", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 381000000, "381", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 28.65, "28.65", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["AmountChangeNetSales", "AmountChangeNetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -1048000000, "1,